<title>USA: FDA to review Medco Bidil NDA in Feb.</title>
<headline>FDA to review Medco Bidil NDA in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>RESEARCH TRIANGLE PARK, N.C. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medco Research Inc said on Tuesday that its New Drug Application (NDA) for Bidil for the treatment of congestive heart failure has been scheduled for consideration by the Cardio-Renal Advisory Committee of the U.S. Food and Drug Administration at its February 27-28, 1997 meeting.</p>
</text>
